search_code_actions {
    when cursor is in a [reference], there shouls be a code action to search for references to that idea.
    it should also allow wrapping a selected string, or the word at the cursor when in idea-body prose, as a new [reference].
    it should open up a webview modal that shows a search dialog that allows the user to search for potential references.
    the search menu should preserve/show the context of the would-be reference: the rest of the containing idea, with styling, and with the selected text pulsing / styled prominently.
    it should support fuzzy/partial searching via [search_analysis.fuzzy_search]. it should list the closest matches in a paginated view.
    selecting the idea should fill/replace the reference (or wrap the selection as [name]) and an import (if required) appropiately
    The lightbulb command (`reqlan.searchReference`) is arg-less because VS Code caches arg-bearing code-action commands and may dispose them on refresh ("Actual command not found … /N").
    At invoke time the extension resolves the site via LSP `reqlan/referenceSearchSite`, or a local parse of the active editor when the language client is not yet running — it must not fail with a false "language server is not ready" when a local site can be resolved.
    @status done
    @implementation (
        ["../../packages/language/src/reqlan-idea-reference-site.ts"]
        ["../../packages/language/src/reqlan-reference-search-site.ts"]
        ["../../packages/language/src/reqlan-code-action-provider.ts"]
        ["../../packages/extension/src/extension/reference-search-panel.ts"]
        ["../../packages/extension/src/extension/reference-search-import-path.ts"]
        ["../../packages/analytical/src/analysis/fuzzy-search.ts"]
        ["../../packages/analytical/src/analysis/fuzzy-search-analyser.ts"]
        ["../../packages/extension/src/extension/register-import-error-commands.ts"]
        ["../../packages/extension/src/extension/main.ts"]
        ["../../packages/extension/src/language/main.ts"]
    )
    @tests (
        ["../../packages/language/test/code-actions.test.ts"]
        ["../../packages/extension/test/reference-search.test.ts"]
        ["../../packages/extension/test/extension-package.test.ts"]
        ["../../packages/analytical/test/fuzzy-search.test.ts"]
    )
}

