barrel_page {
    When a `.rq` page grows large, barrel it into a container: create one sibling file per top-level idea, import those files into the current page, and replace the page body with a single container idea whose name the user chooses (default: the sanitized file basename).
    Same-file sibling refs are rewritten to qualified imports in the child files. Existing page imports are copied into each child. Top-level ideasets are preserved in the container file.
    Behaviour lives in ["../core-architecture.rq".analytical_package] and is exposed via [cli] / ["../cli/cli_package.rq".commands] (`reqlan barrel`).
    Extension: file-level source code action **Barrel page into container…** and command palette **Barrel Page** (`reqlan.barrelPage`) prompt for the container name, confirm, then create child files and rewrite the active page via WorkspaceEdit.
    Related: [file_based_code_actions] [decompose]
    @status done
    @implementation (
        ["../../packages/analytical/src/core/barrel-page.ts"]
        ["../../packages/cli/src/commands/barrel.ts"]
        ["../../packages/cli/src/main.ts"]
        ["../../packages/language/src/reqlan-code-action-provider.ts"]
        ["../../packages/extension/src/refactor_module/register-barrel-page-command.ts"]
        ["../../packages/extension/src/refactor_module/barrel-page-apply.ts"]
        ["../../packages/extension/package.json"]
    )
    @tests (
        ["../../packages/analytical/test/barrel-page.test.ts:creates one child file per idea and a container defaulting to file basename"]
        ["../../packages/analytical/test/barrel-page.test.ts:writes child files and replaces the source with a container"]
        ["../../packages/language/test/code-actions.test.ts:offers barrel page source action when the file has top-level ideas"]
        ["../../packages/language/test/code-actions.test.ts:omits barrel page when only quickfix is requested or there are no ideas"]
        ["../../packages/extension/test/barrel-page-apply.test.ts:maps child file names next to the source path"]
        ["../../packages/extension/test/barrel-page-apply.test.ts:detects overwrite conflicts and source-self collision"]
    )
}

